            "result_text": "Done! The regex has been saved to `/app/regex.txt`.\n\nHere's how it works:\n\n**Structure:**\n1. **Positive lookahead** `(?=^.*\\bIPv4\\b.*$)` - Ensures the line contains a valid IPv4 address\n2. **Date pattern** `\\b\\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12][0-9])\\b` - Matches YYYY-MM-DD with:\n   - Year: any 4 digits\n   - Month: 01-12 (via `0[1-9]|1[0-2]`)\n   - Day: 01-29 (via `0[1-9]|[12][0-9]`)\n3. **Negative lookahead** `(?!.*\\b\\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12][0-9])\\b)` - Ensures no more dates follow on that line\n\n**IPv4 octet validation** uses `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9]?[0-9])` to match 0-255 without leading zeros by matching:\n- 250-255 | 200-249 | 100-199 | 0-99\n\n**Word boundaries** (`\\b`) prevent false positives like \"user1192.168.1.1\" or \"1134-12-1234\"."
